Vidso is a small static HTML/JS site (about 15 source files). Never spawn subagents, explore agents, background Task agents, computer-use agents, or screen recordings. Do not open a browser to "verify" UI. Search and edit files directly.

Do not read, index, or open: `vendor/`, `assets/`, `clips/`, `fonts/`, `avatars/`, `toolimg/`, or any `.mp4` / `.png` / `.woff2`.

Where to edit:
- Dashboard behavior: `dashboard/app.js`
- Dashboard markup: `dashboard/index.html`
- Dashboard CSS: `dashboard/styles.css`
- Marketing page: `home/index.html` and `home/styles.css`
- API client: `api.js`
